{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":69,"count":34,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-3-06\",\"晚饭\",\"晚飯\",\"晚饭\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"下班以後，我常跟同事一起去吃晚飯。","pinyin":"Xiàbān yǐhòu, wǒ cháng gēn tóngshì yìqǐ qù chī wǎnfàn.","english":"After getting off work, I often go to eat dinner with colleagues.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-04","sourceFront":"同事","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"弟弟的手很髒，我叫他先把手洗一洗，再吃晚飯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-19","sourceFront":"叫","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽不在，晚飯我得自己弄。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-09","sourceFront":"弄","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李先生每天晚上六點前一定要吃晚飯，八點後就什麼東西都不吃了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-04","sourceFront":"後","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爸爸下班以後，總是先洗個澡、喝個飲料，再吃晚飯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-09","sourceFront":"個","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L05-3-07\",\"猫\",\"貓\",\"猫\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的貓在房子外面曬太陽。","pinyin":"Wǒ de māo zài fángzi wàimiàn shài tàiyáng.","english":"My cat is basking in the sun outside the house.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-11","sourceFront":"曬太陽/晒太陽","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我家有一隻貓、兩隻狗和三隻鳥。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā yǒu yì zhī māo, liǎng zhī gǒu hé sān zhī niǎo.","english":"I have a cat, two dogs, and three birds in my house.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-10","sourceFront":"隻","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"越南也有十二生肖，可是我們沒有兔年，有貓年。我是貓年出生的，屬貓。","pinyin":"Yuènán yě yǒu shí'èr shēngxiào, kěshì wǒmen méi yǒu tù nián, yǒu māo nián. Wǒ shì māo nián chūshēng de, shǔ māo.","english":"There are also zodiac signs in Vietnam, but we don’t have the year of the Rabbit; we have the year of the Cat. I was born in the year of the Cat, which means my zodiac animal sign is cat.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L12-1-07\",\"記者\",\"記者\",\"记者\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我覺得當記者不容易，週末常常不能休息。","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde dāng jìzhě bù róngyì, zhōumò chángcháng bù néng xiūxí.","english":"I think being a reporter is not easy; often I can't rest on weekends.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-07","sourceFront":"記者","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"記者說參加這次慢跑活動的人數已經超過了一百人，可是我數來數去只有五十幾個。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-12","sourceFront":"數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統抵達新聞說明會的現場前，安全人員得先確認記者的資料，還得檢查他們的背包。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-01","sourceFront":"抵達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"歷史系的李教授最近經常接受記者的訪問，因此變得很有名","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那名記者為了訪問總統外交、貿易等方面的問題，閱讀了許多相關的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這位記者專門報導社會新聞，他報新聞的方式相當專業。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-02","sourceFront":"報","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"記(record) + 者(person) → the person who records events: 記者 is a reporter."},{"key":"[\"B2L03-2-14\",\"生活\",\"生活\",\"生活\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"到國外生活以前，得先找租房子的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-14","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"山本良介覺得在台灣生活的費用(生活費)不太高，日本的比較高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-14","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在外國跟在自己國家的生活一定不太一樣。","pinyin":"Zài wàiguó gēn zài zìjǐ guójiā de shēnghuó yídìng bú tài yíyàng.","english":"Living in a foreign country and living in your own country are definitely not quite the same.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-08","sourceFront":"外國","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我在台灣的生活不錯，很喜歡這裡，也有很多好朋友。","pinyin":"Wǒ zài Táiwān de shēnghuó búcuò, hěn xǐhuan zhèlǐ, yě yǒu hěn duō hǎo péngyou.","english":"My life in Taiwan is good; I like it here a lot, and I also have many good friends.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-3-13","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請你想像一下，二十年以後，你的生活會怎麼樣？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-15","sourceFront":"想像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上中文課時，老師要我們用中文報告在台灣的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-10","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個老人年紀太大，沒辦法一個人生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-29","sourceFront":"老人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的家人非常關心我在國外的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-17","sourceFront":"關心","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"很多大學生都打過工，因為得自己付生活費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-07","sourceFront":"打工","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為科技越來越進步了，所以生活也變得更便利了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-20","sourceFront":"科技","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"沒有人會永遠活著，所以我們每天都要開開心心地生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-23","sourceFront":"永遠","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的理想是找到一份正式的工作，過幸福的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-10","sourceFront":"理想","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了給孩子幸福的生活，很多父母一輩子都努力地工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-11","sourceFront":"輩子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我室友的生活習慣很差，我已經忍耐他很久了，真希望他馬上搬走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-41","sourceFront":"忍耐","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在我爺爺奶奶的年代，生活比較辛苦，不少窮人為了省錢，衣服破了還是繼續穿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-24","sourceFront":"破","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個社區的周圍有山有水，空氣也很好，這樣的生活環境很適合退休的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-07","sourceFront":"周圍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔先生很重視生活品質，也很喜歡做家事，所以總是把家裡整理得乾乾淨淨的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-23","sourceFront":"整理","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"軍人用卡車把食物和生活用品送到災區，發給需要的民眾。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-31","sourceFront":"發","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有集合大家的力量，有錢出錢、有力出力，才能幫助災民早一點恢復正常生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-32","sourceFront":"出力","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"市場為了改善兒童和青少年的生活品質，而增加了球場、游泳池等休閒場所。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-14","sourceFront":"場所","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我家在大馬路旁，從早到晚噪音不斷，嚴重影響了生活品質，所以決定搬家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-09","sourceFront":"噪音","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他參加了服務社團的活動後，生活比過去更豐富、更有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-28","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區不僅沒有地震、颱風，而且天氣好、空氣新鮮，生活環境安全又舒適。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-15","sourceFront":"舒適","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少外國人說，臺灣最大的魅力是人們能夠接受不同的文化、語言和想法，所以在臺灣生活非常自在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-31","sourceFront":"魅力","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當人們生活水準提高，開始重視生活品質時，休閒活動也就跟著多了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-31","sourceFront":"水準","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李小姐結婚以後的生活重心就是家庭，尤其是照顧剛出生的小孩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-01","sourceFront":"尤其","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"市長解決了不少這個城市的生活問題，因此民眾的生活水準也大大提高了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-20","sourceFront":"大大","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得減少工作，增加有意義的休閒活動，這樣的生活比較充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-21","sourceFront":"減少","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"陳先生有五個孩子，生活費負擔很大","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-24","sourceFront":"負擔","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小連跟老闆吵架而離開了公司，為了讓家人能繼續過安定的生活，他正努力地找新工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-05","sourceFront":"安定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"正常的生活作息，對身體和心理健康都很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-18","sourceFront":"作息","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過社群網站，我們可以加入感興趣的社團，讓自己的生活更充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-35","sourceFront":"社群網站","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代各式各樣的科技產品，讓人們的生活更舒適、便利","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-02","sourceFront":"現代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都希望自己的孩子有幸福的生活、美好的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-13","sourceFront":"人人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何先生早就習慣了單身生活，一點都不想結婚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-25","sourceFront":"單身","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都渴望浪漫的愛情和幸福的家庭，不過自由自在的單身生活也是不錯的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-29","sourceFront":"愛情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"結婚之前，那對情侶認真規劃了未來的生活，沒想到結婚一個月之後就離婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-25","sourceFront":"之前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個美國人每天看臺灣的連續劇，一方面學習中文，一方面了解臺灣的生活文化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-26","sourceFront":"一方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"外國人在臺灣生活期間，如果遇到任何問題，都可以打0800-024111，請求協助","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-22","sourceFront":"請求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人的一生只有短短幾十年，應該把握時間，讓生活過得充實、 快樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-30","sourceFront":"一生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座城市不但交通十分便利，生活水準也很高，大家都想搬來這裡住。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-10","sourceFront":"十分","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要維持社區良好的生活品質，就要從不亂丟垃圾、減少家庭噪音做起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-13","sourceFront":"維持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人口增加不僅影響生活品質，恐怕也會造成食物缺乏的問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-18","sourceFront":"人口","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家發明了電燈，改變了人類的生活方式，也大大提高了生活品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當鄰居生活遇到困難時，老馬總是主動提供協助，真令人感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-04","sourceFront":"令","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於雲端科技的進步，人類的生活方式跟以往比起來有很大的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-07","sourceFront":"由於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了愛惜食物資源，同時也幫助生活困難的家庭，張老闆決定在國內開幾家食物銀行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-15","sourceFront":"開","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他這幾年因為投資生意發了，婚姻生活也很幸福，運氣非常好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-31","sourceFront":"發","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機雖然使生活更便利，但過度使用也可能傷害身心健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-23","sourceFront":"過度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類過度的發展活動，已對動植物的生活環境造成嚴重破壞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-23","sourceFront":"過度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們無法決定生命的長度，卻能夠決定生活的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-09","sourceFront":"長度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他愛亂花錢，三天下來，就把一個月的生活費花光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-02","sourceFront":"下來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他昨天在酒吧的花費，比我一個月的生活費還高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-13","sourceFront":"花費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個時代都有自己的價值標準，社會習俗及生活規矩也常隨著時代改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-15","sourceFront":"規矩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類破壞了自然，就是破壞了自己的生活環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-30","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從前有很多生活用具都是用銅做的，像銅杯、銅碗什麼的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-09","sourceFront":"銅","sourceB