essonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天開會時，經理表面上對老闆很客氣，其實心裡很不高興。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-10","sourceFront":"上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我等一下要開會，不方便接電話，有事就用手機傳訊息給我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-14","sourceFront":"傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的會議資料我已經上傳到雲端，請各位開會前先了解要討論的內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-23","sourceFront":"上傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸虧我把資料都存在雲端，要不然找不到隨身碟，怎麼開會呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-29","sourceFront":"幸虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們約好下星期一在線上開會，討論辦員工運動會的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-02","sourceFront":"線上","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開會時他遲到了，只好悄悄地坐在會議室後面。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-03","sourceFront":"悄悄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開會前經理要求大家勿開手機，專心討論會議內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-10","sourceFront":"勿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"連經理很講話，開會時老是說個不停，別人都沒說話的分。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-05","sourceFront":"分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"等一會兒開會時麻煩你負責打字，把開會的內容記錄下來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-39","sourceFront":"打字","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？昨天晚上沒睡好嗎？ B:嗯。要不是開夜車趕報告， 現在也不會這麼沒精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-36","sourceFront":"嗯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥的性格開朗、樂觀，遇到麻煩也不會往壞處想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-09","sourceFront":"開朗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們大學前年