","examples":[{"chinese":"華語文中心的學生邀請台灣朋友來參加世界文化日的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-01","sourceFront":"邀請","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學校邀請李教授來演講，內容相當精彩，讓我有很大的收穫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-30","sourceFront":"精彩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你帶著邀請卡給門口的服務人員檢查，才能入場參加活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-14","sourceFront":"入場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我通常在家吃晚餐，只有好朋友邀請我吃飯，才會出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-29","sourceFront":"通常","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次座談會邀請了各領域的人們，主要目的是對國內的地方建設提一些建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-38","sourceFront":"座談會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機廠商時常邀請明星替他們的產品宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-14","sourceFront":"廠商","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我與高中同學已十多年沒見了，想找個適當時間邀請大家聚聚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-13","sourceFront":"適當","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在全球環境會議中，聯合國邀請了一些環保團體共同參與。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-39","sourceFront":"聯合國","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-13\",\"数字\",\"數字\",\"数字\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華人喜歡像二、六、八的數字，這幾個數字都是雙數，有很多好事一起來的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-14","sourceFront":"雙數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-1-07\",\"周围\",\"周圍\",\"周围\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個社區的周圍有山有水，空氣也很好，這樣的生活環境很適合退休的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-07","sourceFront":"周圍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"臺灣是一個海島國家，周圍的海底有豐富的珍貴資源。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-02","sourceFront":"島","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"台灣的周圍都是海，還有不少美麗的海灘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-21","sourceFront":"海灘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當周圍環境很靜的時候，可以聽見平常聽不到的聲音。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-45","sourceFront":"靜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"露營最開心的就是當營火(campfire)燃燒時，大家在營火周圍又唱又跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-41","sourceFront":"燃燒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在瀑布旁邊照相要看看周圍環境，別不小心掉下去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-36","sourceFront":"瀑布","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-2-35\",\"降低\",\"降低\",\"降低\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從明天起天氣會變冷，溫度會比今天降低五度，出門時最好穿上外套。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-35","sourceFront":"降低","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"國內幾家銀行決定從明年起，降低跨行匯款的手續費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-26","sourceFront":"跨行","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"水災過後應立刻打掃環境，才能降低傳染病流行的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-03","sourceFront":"傳染病","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對學生來說，經常失眠可能降低學習效率。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-42","sourceFront":"效率","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 降(descend) and 低(low): 降低 means lower."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-1-01\",\"穿着\",\"穿著\",\"穿着\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個明星對穿著很講究，總是花很多時間，研究什麼上衣配什麼長褲才好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-01","sourceFront":"穿著","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"東西方的文化差異很大，像穿著、音樂、哲學等風格都不相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-03","sourceFront":"風格","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你在名牌服裝的專櫃工作，我想聽聽看你對穿著和品味的看法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-05","sourceFront":"看法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"小何穿著綠色牛仔褲、紅襯衫，再戴上藍色的帽子，我覺得這些顏色配在一起很醜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-26","sourceFront":"醜","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"白小姐平時對穿著不怎麼講究，衣服穿來穿去總是那幾件。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-12","sourceFront":"平時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"小張不僅長得帥，穿著也很有品味，所以很多人都以為他是明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-20","sourceFront":"帥","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我認為多看時尚雜誌、多看模特兒怎麼穿衣服，應該就能使自己的穿著更有品味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-17","sourceFront":"使","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"童先生穿著一件綠色的襯衫，配上一條咖啡色的褲子，看起來真像一棵樹。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-20","sourceFront":"配","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"王小姐跟男朋友約會的時候，都穿著很漂亮的衣服。今天晚上哥哥跟女朋友有個約會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-17","sourceFront":"約會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"電影明星一向很重視自己的穿著，合適的穿著才能讓他們更有品味、更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-05","sourceFront":"一向","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你最好別穿著拖鞋去參加正式活動，要不然別人可能認為你不懂禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-29","sourceFront":"拖鞋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天氣這麼熱，你居然穿著一件大外套，不覺得不舒服嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-08","sourceFront":"居然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L09-2-10\",\"笔记\",\"筆記\",\"笔记\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上課時他把筆記寫在本子上，也把重點寫在不同顏色的便條(紙)上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-13","sourceFront":"便條","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我同學記筆記的速度很快，也記得很清楚，所以我常跟他借筆記來複習功課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-17","sourceFront":"記","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L09-2-20\",\"大大\",\"大大\",\"大大\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"市長解決了不少這個城市的生活問題，因此民眾的生活水準也大大提高了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-20","sourceFront":"大大","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"張太太一個人管三個孩子，家裡大大小小的事情也是她負責的，太辛苦了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-14","sourceFront":"管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家發明了電燈，改變了人類的生活方式，也大大提高了生活品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Repeating 大(big) twice for emphasis: 大大 means greatly."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-1-29\",\"说起来\",\"說起來\",\"说起来\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:聽說小金離婚了，你知道是怎麼回事嗎？ B:唉，這件事說起來都要怪小金，誰教他愛上了別的女生呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-29","sourceFront":"說起來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L14-1-32\",\"結局\",\"結局\",\"结局\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那部電影沒有結局，是導演要留給觀眾想像的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-32","sourceFront":"結局","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"喜劇中的男女主角，不論相處過程中碰到多少挫折，結局總是快樂又幸福的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-06","sourceFront":"喜劇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Tying the final 結(knot) on the overall 局(bureau) situation: 結局 means ending."},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-28\",\"懒\",\"懶\",\"懒\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小張的個性比較懶，很少主動幫同事的忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-28","sourceFront":"懶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"參加旅行團或自助旅遊各有各的優點，懶得自己安排行程的人，就跟著導遊走吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-12","sourceFront":"旅行團","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他對人很不客氣，因此大家都懶得理他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-05","sourceFront":"懶得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-39\",\"瓜子\",\"瓜子\",\"瓜子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"中國人看傳統戲劇時都喜歡準備一盤瓜子，邊吃邊欣賞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-39","sourceFront":"瓜子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-37\",\"登山\",\"登山\",\"登山\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"登山的時候得注意安全，事前多準備，才能享受登山的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-37","sourceFront":"登山","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我去澳洲登山時，碰見了正在自助旅行的老朋友，真巧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-01","sourceFront":"碰見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-50\",\"误点\",\"誤點\",\"误点\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這班飛機因為天氣不穩定，所以誤點了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-50","sourceFront":"誤點","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-20\",\"外觀\",\"外觀\",\"外观\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"網路購物辦理退貨時，必須保持商品原來的外觀才行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-20","sourceFront":"外觀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這面金牌是完全用金子做的，外觀也相當獨特。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-52","sourceFront":"金牌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"全身\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 全(whole) and 身(body): 全身 means the whole body."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"吃苦\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 吃(eat) a 苦(bitter): 吃苦 means endure hardship and suffering."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"唱\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) opens wide in warm 昌(sunlight) → to 唱(sing)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"報\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A grant of royal 幸(favor) stamped with a 卩(seal) is carried out 又(again) to proudly 報(announce) good news."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"失\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A loose stroke 丿(slash) slips off the head of the 夫(man), causing him to 失(lose) his balance."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"室內\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 室(room) and 內(inside): 室內 means indoors."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"就\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 京(capital) gate opens with 尤(yóu) flair → and 就(then) we enter."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"弱\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A brittle hunting 弓(bow) frozen over by delicate crystals of 冫(ice) snaps easily because it is too 弱(weak)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"房客\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 房(building) and 客(guest): 房客 means tenant."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"由\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A sprout emerges straight out of the center of a fertile 田(field), marking the origin and 由(cause)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"許\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 言(speech) at 午(noon) seals a deal → 許(consent)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"週\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 辶(movement) takes a 周(zhōu) turn → one full 週(week) done."}]}
